  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DreamWorld.Town.NpcTalk
  range: 2.3
  npcName: Mayor Mothwick
  lines:
  - welcome to mushroom hollow, the coziest town in the dream!
  - the town square is a safe zone. no fighting, please.
  - want your own home? the land office east of the well sells plots.
  - beware the shroomlings past the paths.
